          ],
          "id": "camps",
          "lines": [
            "Camp 1 sits by the west wall. Mind their pistols: they draw, then fire. Step aside when they draw.",
            "The rack behind me restocks your rounds. There's an ammo box at every camp."
          ]
        },
        {
          "choices": [
            {
